  "note": "This is the Sky1 arm64 DEFAULT and installer boot kernel under the unified 7.3 policy (operator 2026-10-05): there is no edge channel and assets/kernel/mainline points at this r285 build. r285 = r284 + 0005 (CIX 0028 ACPI fixed regulators: the O6N RTL8127 root ports were blocked by 12 unbound PRP0001 rails) + 0006-0011 (ACPI pinctrl deferral, cdnsp-sky1 wrapper runtime-PM hold, audss ACPI parent clocks incl. the MS-R1 'clk freq 0' playback failure, pwm_bl CIXH5041, linlondp _STA 0 DPUs, SpecSEI non-strict) + CRYPTO_ZSTD=m + I2C_CHARDEV=m. The PCIe default is unchanged (sky1_pcie_native=off pcie_pnp_en). The rescue entry boots this same kernel with the arm64 accelerator blacklist. Overlay .ko are mirrored under assets/kernel/<drv>/7.3.0-rc6-sky1-ncz/ (kernel OE GCC 15.3, includes the mali DKMS detach fix). Test-only until operator-supervised O6N/MS-R1 metal validation; replaced by 7.3.0 final later.",
